Rust profiling implementation

Summary:
- Added DHAT-based Rust-native memory profiling example and wrapper script for native logistic kernel slices.
- Added CI compile gate for the memory profiler example.
- Updated Rust README, Rust core roadmap, and tech stack to document CPU, memory, and GPU profiling ownership.
- Clarified that the core is not yet entirely Rust; unsupported model families and payload shapes still fall back to the Python kernel.

Validation:
- cargo fmt --check
- cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings
- cargo check --example profile_memory_native_kernels
- cargo bench --bench native_kernel --no-run
- INNOVATE_RUST_MEMORY_PROFILE_ITERATIONS=2 ./scripts/profile_memory_native_kernels.sh
- cargo test
- pytest tests/unit/test_conductor_workflow_docs.py tests/unit/test_benchmark_docs.py tests/unit/test_rust_binding_docs.py tests/unit/test_rust_core_roadmap_docs.py
- cargo package --allow-dirty
